{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set ostimNetSettings = ostimnet_settings(player.UUID) %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} decides whether the partner should pull out before climaxing or is permitted to finish inside.
Use 'request_pullout' when wanting or pleading with the partner to pull out or finish inside before ejaculating, 'allow_finish_inside' when wanting or permitting them to finish inside, or 'doesnt_care' if indifferent. Conception & Pregnancy Awareness: {% if ostimNetSettings.internalClimaxPromptCue and speakingNpc.isFemale %}
    {% if is_plugin_loaded("Fertility Mode.esm") %}
        {% set fertilityRank = get_faction_rank(speakingNpc.UUID, "ImmersiveEffectsFaction") %}
        {% if fertilityRank == 118 %}
        - **High chance of pregnancy (peak fertile days)**
        {% elif fertilityRank == 117 %}
        - **Rising chance of pregnancy (fertile days approaching)**
        {% elif fertilityRank == 116 or fertilityRank == 119 %}
        - **Safe days (cannot get pregnant)**
        {% elif fertilityRank >= 1 and fertilityRank <= 100 %}
        - **Already pregnant (cannot get pregnant again)**
        {% elif fertilityRank >= 101 and fertilityRank <= 115 %}
        - **Recovering after birth (safe)**
        {% elif fertilityRank == 120 %}
        - **In labor (safe)**
        {% else %}
        - Sex and finishing inside can lead to pregnancy.
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
